      "created_at": "2019-06-04T11:03:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How do you guys track your wins, your most used characters, most hated villains, those that defeat you on a regular basis, and those who are a walk in the park regardless of your team composition?</p>\n<p>It seems like the mobility of the game encourages me to play in various locations: bed, couch, train, bus, etc. But then - it's easy to put down, no clean-up time, and I don't really keep track of the victories/losses. Does anyone use any tracking tools, sheets, notepads? Or is it just me being a statistics geek?</p>",
